{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-15_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-15","title":"堅城高牆","storyCode":"10-17","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"91ca01729aeda77d43ddee537f7caeab04404ace26921f4c98c5e15b16120450","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"高牆上，阿米婭與曼弗雷德戰鬥，而號角率領著維多利亞士兵，幫助阿米婭拖住了曼弗雷德的腳步。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"12-beg"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......曼弗雷德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來血魔大君要失望了。他最為厭惡陰暗潮濕的地方，卻為了親手抓住你而去了反抗軍的地下巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下他一定已經追上了你們的同伴。不知道地底的嚎哭能不能傳到這高牆之上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這邪惡的......邪惡的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邪惡的魔族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我並不欣賞他的手段。相比遭受那樣的折磨，死在我的炮轟之下的反抗軍要幸運得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們根本就沒有差別！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們眼裡或許是這樣。當你們只會用“魔族”來統一稱呼我們的時候，恐懼與仇恨就早已蒙蔽了你們的雙眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在維多利亞人眼裡，薩卡茲就是一群享受著殺戮的大傻瓜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經這麼想的人，如今要嘛跪倒在殿下的王座下，要嘛成了城牆外風乾的慘白骨架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和特雷西斯......你們帶領的軍隊蹂躪了這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你怎麼宣稱自己與血魔的差異，你們都是雙手沾滿了鮮血的侵略者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎誤會了，羅德島的卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不只想強調自己與大君的差異——是的，在某些方面，他的喜好令我厭惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我同樣不會像諸王廷臣一樣行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當他們站在你面前的時候，看到的是那位殿下的繼承人，他們或許會因此對你感到懷疑、好奇或者厭惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只從你身上感覺到了警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，卡特斯。我只當你是——危險的敵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——他往我們這裡扔手榴彈了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快抓住城牆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是他的源石技藝......他正在用法術能量製造衝擊，他想把我們丟下城牆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......好難站穩，這腳底下就像哪裡都在炸開一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機沒法靠近他！只要離得近一點，機身就會失去平衡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家......站到我身後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿、阿米婭，他的法術在融化你的法術？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他故意把法術衝擊釋放得又細小又尖銳，我編織的能量結層被他絞碎了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你甚至能抵擋德拉克的火焰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他熟悉我們的戰鬥方式。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他的法術針對了阿米婭。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明知道你們要來，難道我會白白等待？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了，又來了！不僅在腳下，還、還有天上，只要赤光一閃，就會憑空炸開——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小姐，你......你不是會心靈法術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能試著給他的腦袋瓜裡塞點什麼垃圾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他防禦得很好，而且他太冷靜了，我能觸摸到他情感的邊緣，但是......但是他此刻心裡只有對勝利的渴望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他在拖時間。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......他的心思並不在眼前這場戰鬥上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只想等著血魔和城防炮將反抗軍的生機全部摧毀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拖時間？不錯的猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，比起那位僥倖獲得了魔王力量的卡特斯，我一直對你更感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你過去曾經在戰場上面臨過更嚴峻的情形——你似乎總能做出對整體結果更有利的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請告訴我，接下來你準備怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會為了排除長期威脅，盡全力在這裡擊殺我，還是想其他辦法繞開我，拯救底下那些維多利亞人的性命？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚嗚哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白輪先生，前面的路怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"通道出現局部坍塌！三位戰士沒有來得及躲開——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繞開坍塌！我們繼續往前走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，這一路上，無論有誰犧牲，我們都不能停下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上來，快上來，看到列車了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子薩卡茲還沒發現我們，我們想辦法混上車，把控制權搶到手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈默哥，小心！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是薩卡茲狙擊手！他們在埋伏我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我們只要一冒頭，就會被打！我們最好馬上掉頭回地下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去......更危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官說了，我們唯一的機會就是在薩卡茲毀掉地下空間之前，讓列車動起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是哈默他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈默隊長犧牲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前負責指揮的人是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好，我們必須在炮擊中斷之後，立刻開動列車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我倒下了，那就換下一個人——就算最後只剩下一個人，我們也必須讓那個人從這裡逃出去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這道門......是不是又要守不住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，我們去攔住他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別去，你們攔不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......羅德島的朋友，我們難道不知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十三隊的戰士們，跟我上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們怎麼往回跑，別做傻事——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"門、門破了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"射擊，射擊！榴彈！一起上！我們跟這怪物拼了！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......呃啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i15"},{"type":"narration","text":"煙塵散去，一道身影出現在漆黑通道的盡頭。\n那並不是什麼張牙舞爪的怪物，沒有扭曲的肢體，沒有尖銳的獠牙和利齒，也並未長出什麼多餘的觸鬚。\n他看起來就像一個照片會被刊登在報紙上，喜好對倫蒂尼姆的政治經濟局勢侃侃而談的年輕貴族。\n假如......他腳下的地面不是浸透了鮮血的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好臭的味道。你們的戰鬥方式未免太髒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......你休想靠近指揮官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我的手？還沒碰到就——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......這氣味就舒適多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不介意......用你們身上唯一有價值的東西清洗一下地面。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔輕輕抬起手指，就像舉起一個水晶酒杯，或者應和一段音樂的節拍。\n陰影自他腳下一躍而起，捉住了戰士們的軀體，纏繞上他們的四肢。\n慘叫聲完全被噴湧而出的液體吞沒。\n濃烈的血腥味鑽入了鼻腔。鮮紅色溢滿了整個視野。\n站在通道另一頭的人瞬間明白過來。\n追逐著他們的原來並不是陰影，而是濃稠到了極致的血液。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"華法琳和可露希爾......她們本來的面目也是這樣子的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想說的第一句話竟然是這個？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然你讓我想什麼？總比滿腦子都是害怕來得強吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑啊，趕緊跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得我願意走這麼遠來覲見她，她竟然躲在你們這些弱小生物的背後，不敢與我見面？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是來找阿米婭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說他嘴裡那個什麼什麼王？你確定那是指阿米婭？阿米婭不是卡特斯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，這不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是阿米婭不在這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，也對。就算是阿米婭，也未必能擋得住這老怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道她和博士是不是快成功了......唉，我想什麼呢，就算他們能關閉城防炮，眼下我們也快被撕成碎片了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，我們該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不想......更不能死在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能再這樣僵持下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，退後一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我會凝聚更強的能量，我必須儘快擊敗曼弗雷德......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，請相信我。自從上一次解除限制，我成長了許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我們才剛剛進入倫蒂尼姆，我不會放任自己在這裡倒下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他希望你這麼做。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......他的能量釋放變得更密集了！就像......就像一張網一樣，頭頂，腳下......到處都是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空氣裡......都是看不見的源石結晶！他把這些分散的結晶當成攻擊的信標！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪，這效果簡直就像有隱形無人機到處扔炸彈一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特先生，你和可露希爾必須離遠一些......萬一被捲進來，你們不可能躲得開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還可以更用力一些，卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這能量流......正在受我的法術催動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感受一下吧，這是你親手編織的牢籠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越掙扎......就越無法掙脫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，你說我的心思並不在與你戰鬥上，你只說對了一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把你綁到殿下面前。倫蒂尼姆城內的薩卡茲們......並不想看見一位異族人借著君主的力量到處招搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能，也並不想號令他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們也不該被特雷西斯號令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在卡茲戴爾逗留的時候，見過很多薩卡茲戰士。他們之中的很多都是雇傭兵。後來，在切爾諾伯格......我又一次見到了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是在被塔露拉利用的時候，他們也至少知道自己每一次戰鬥的敵人是誰，知道自己是在用命換第二天用得上的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在呢？你們把他們困在了一座異族的都城裡，從我進入的那一刻起，我就感受到了他們的憤怒，焦躁，還有迷茫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讀了我的戰士們的情感？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又......收緊了？你在憤怒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，有沒有人告訴過你，你太自負？你不過就是一個感染者，你從來沒有體驗過真正屬於薩卡茲的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅僅是在一旁看著，你憑什麼認為自己真的能理解我們的痛苦與憤恨？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，也許我不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......燒在你們心中的那把火，它從遙遠的過去一直燒到現在，從最初的卡茲戴爾燒到如今的倫蒂尼姆，至今也仍在我心中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是滾燙的。那種滾燙無比真實，遠勝任何言語和法術能帶來的幻覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你怎麼說，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚你這股力量的由來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個謊言被編織出來之後，並不會因為撒謊的人自己也深信不疑，就變得更加真實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你給我們各自安的是什麼身份，我們都只是想在種種不公正的境遇中活下來的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而特雷西斯卻把所有人帶入了一場無望的戰爭中——看看城外那些維多利亞大公爵的軍隊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要哪一天他們的矛指向了同一個方向，卡茲戴爾也好，倫蒂尼姆也好，等著薩卡茲的都只有毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你們在用什麼驅使他們，血統，權位，名利......這才統統都是謊言！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......倉促之間重新編織了能量，撐開了一點空間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有想錯，卡特斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的力量，你的言辭......雖然無法撼動我們最堅強的戰士，但的確會給我們的敵人帶去希望的幻象。我不想讓他們掙扎更久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只能在這裡停下來。我不會再讓你進入這座城市——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我會踏碎你的牢籠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這恐怕還稱不上什麼牢籠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在改變我法術的能量密度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，又是你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我是不是來得有點遲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"要在倫蒂尼姆的城牆內部找到一條通路......就算是我，也很困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"好在我找到了幾位出色的幫手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"辛苦你了，Misery。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，我們換個戰場。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可露希爾，無人機定位。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"費斯特，滑索。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"現在，我們跳下去。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"數分鐘前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我在人群中鎖定了曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，他身邊人很少......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他並不害怕我們接近他。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是不是超能打啊？我看他的樣子就很能打，說不定特雷西斯教了他好多招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們真能在五分鐘之內把他揍得老老實實停下炮擊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我說錯了，沒有什麼我們。到了這一步，戰鬥力方面你不能把我和費斯特算上。搞後勤的衝上去就是送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，只能靠你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德是強敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們這一路上......以及前面還會遇上的，強敵一定不會少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，你要吸引曼弗雷德的全部注意。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可露希爾和費斯特準備好從牆上撤退。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們等的人就快來了。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故技重施，你真的以為我會讓你帶人逃走第二次？"},{"type":"narration","text":"一股能量急衝而來，彷彿能在空氣中鎖定方位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你幾乎覺得那劍鋒觸到了自己的腳尖。\n直到一面盾擋在了你們面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，你別想追上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的對手在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白狼，我沒想到你會再次來到我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這通道竟然是雙向的，在帶走他們的同時，把你送了上來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是我，是我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i07"},{"type":"narration","text":"在號角身後，一個士兵站了起來。\n然後是第二個，第三個。\n十多個維多利亞士兵擋在薩卡茲將軍的身前。\n所有人都不再偽裝。\n他們的制服各式各樣，多數都有著多次戰火灼燒的痕跡，有的沾滿了泥土和蛛網，有的沾上了自己和戰友的鮮血。\n他們手上的武器也各不相同，有的尚拿著制式刀劍，有的卻只能舉著自己做的弓弩。\n但他們臉上都有著相同的神采。\n這一次，除非永遠倒下，否則他們絕不會再後退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一群殘兵，也想戰勝我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿上武器的你也不是我的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道忘了，上一次你能從我手上僥倖逃脫，全憑那個羅德島的薩卡茲插手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別再東張西望了，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在戰場上，不尊重對手的人，一定是先倒下的那一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的嘴說不定比你的盾要硬一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意敵人攻擊方向，盾後集合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我本來就計畫除掉你，但我沒想到你會這麼急著來送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你多少有一些戰術素養，白狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著一群傷兵與我對抗，讓士兵們一個接一個地送命，這就是你所謂的職業精神嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......別忘了你正站在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是倫蒂尼姆的城牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲，不要以為你們已經征服了倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們還站在這裡呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
